Neighborhood label positions (src/data/hoods.json)
  Twenty-three name and point pairs placed from the City of Chicago Data
  Portal's "Boundaries - Neighborhoods" dataset
  (https://data.cityofchicago.org/d/9wp7-iasj), as collected in
  https://github.com/blackmad/neighborhoods. No boundary geometry is
  redistributed.

Lake shore and park outlines
  Simplified shapes drawn for this project along the street centerlines above.

Closure and reopening times, race facts
  From the sources listed in src/content/sources.ts and in the app's Facts tab.
  Facts are not covered by copyright; the wording is this project's own.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; license texts ship beside the font files)
  Big Shoulders (src/app/fonts/BigShoulders-OFL.txt and the map label fonts)
  Instrument Sans (loaded through next/font; map label fonts from
    @fontsource/instrument-sans)
  IBM Plex Mono (loaded through next/font; map label fonts from
    @fontsource/ibm-plex-mono)
  The map label fonts are copied with their LICENSE files into
  public/vendor/fonts/ at build time.

Libraries bundled into the app (each under its own license, in node_modules)
  MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause; its worker is copied into public/vendor/
    maplibre/ at build time), Next.js and React (MIT), Motion (MIT),
  NumberFlow (MIT), Base UI (MIT), GSAP (Standard "No Charge" license, free
  for this use: https://gsap.com/standard-license).
